From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AztecBot <tech@aztec-labs.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 16:46:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: migrate aztec-nr macros to the rc.0 comptime metadata
 API

Type::as_data_type, TypeDefinition::fields, TypeDefinition::generics and
FunctionDefinition::parameters return named structs (DataType,
StructField, FunctionParameter) rather than tuples as of noir
v1.0.0-rc.0, so the tuple destructuring in the macro layer no longer
type-checks.

Taken from AztecProtocol/aztec-packages#25289, whose aztec-nr half did
not travel with the monorepo split.

